# Keepass2Android, at the root group: More options, Synchronize database...; a "Merge changes?"
# question answered as k2a-ans-${SANSWER}.flow does; the events of the next 15 s logged (a toast is
# only there), then what is on screen.
tap More.options
tap ^Synchronize.database
ifthen Merge.changes 25 k2a-ans-${SANSWER}.flow
host sh ${P}/events.sh 15 after-synchronize
dialog
list
